Tools/UI/Generated/

# Working notes for the AI assistant (local only)
SUNTA_CONTEXT.md

# The film used as the opening and the soundtrack of the second sample project is somebody else's work: kept local only
Projects/StrongestInHistoryVsToday/res/Videos/
Projects/StrongestInHistoryVsToday/res/Sounds/Film/
Projects/StrongestInHistoryVsToday/res/Sounds/Voice/

# The user's reference pictures and the generated meshes of the second sample project (real people's likenesses: local only)
Tools/Blender/Concepts/StrongestInHistory/
Tools/Blender/Generated/StrongestInHistory/
# ... and the characters made from them (the game's own models of those real people)
Projects/StrongestInHistoryVsToday/res/Models/Characters/

